<BaseLayout title="Terms, Disclaimers, and Disclosures" description="Review the structured draft terms and disclosures for Shane Perez’s personal professional website." noindex={true}><PageHero eyebrow="Legal Review Draft" title="Terms, Disclaimers, and Disclosures" description="The following structure must be replaced or finalized using Shane’s required company wording and qualified legal or compliance review." breadcrumbs={[{label:'Home',href:'/'},{label:'Terms and Disclosures'}]}/><section class="section"><div class="container prose"><DisclosureNotice type="warning" title="Approval required"><p>[MANULIFE-PROVIDED DISCLOSURE WORDING AND QUALIFIED LEGAL REVIEW REQUIRED BEFORE LAUNCH]</p></DisclosureNotice><h2>Personal website disclosure</h2><p>This is Shane Perez’s personal professional website. It is not the official corporate website of Manulife Philippines or any branch.</p><h2>General information</h2><p>Website content is provided for general professional, educational, and informational purposes. It should not be treated as individualized financial, legal, tax, employment, or career advice.</p><h2>Recruitment disclaimer</h2><p>Submitting an application or inquiry does not guarantee selection, employment, appointment, admission to a program, income, earnings, promotion, team growth, or career success. Final criteria and terms are governed by the authorized process and approved documents.</p><h2>Financial-information disclaimer</h2><p>[APPROVED FINANCIAL AND INSURANCE DISCLAIMER REQUIRED]</p><h2>Testimonials</h2><p>Testimonials reflect individual experiences and do not guarantee similar outcomes. Every published testimonial requires permission and verification.</p><h2>Credentials, awards, events, and statistics</h2><p>Public claims must be verified and approved. Draft placeholders must never be treated as final claims.</p><h2>External links</h2><p>The website may link to external services. Their terms, privacy practices, content, and availability are controlled by their operators.</p><h2>Intellectual property and acceptable use</h2><p>[APPROVED OWNERSHIP, LICENSE, AND USE TERMS REQUIRED]</p><h2>Contact and governing terms</h2><p>[OFFICIAL CONTACT, GOVERNING LAW, DISPUTE PROCESS, AND EFFECTIVE DATE REQUIRED]</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
